1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,348
Meiosis one is the reduction division: two n to n.

2
00:00:04,348 --> 00:00:08,606
In the male it gives two equal secondary spermatocytes.

3
00:00:08,606 --> 00:00:16,966
In the female the split is wildly unequal: one big secondary oocyte, and one tiny first polar body.

